abstract: >-
  Supplementary materials for a scoping review of health-related determinants of
  internal migration among older adults in Canada: the data extraction workbook
  for the 17 included sources of evidence (Table S1), the completed PRISMA-ScR
  checklist (Table S2), and the prompts given to Claude (Anthropic) during data
  extraction and manuscript preparation.
